}

task.chapter_navigation_links_background_issue (completed) {
  the book chapters navigation links still seem to have black background, please change the background to the same background as the book page
}

task.dictionary_on_knowledge_point_modal (completed) {
  reference task.chapter_modal:
  - in the knowledge point modal, if I click on a word, it should show the dictionary modal on top with the word definition
}

task.chapter_modal (completed) {
  when clicking on each point in knowledge graph, open up modal showing the related content for this point of knowledge only! UI should be similar to the dictionary word definition modal
}

task.knowledge_graph_builder (completed) {
  on the left side of the chapter selector:
  - add a button "Knowledge Graph", when click {
    - extract all key main concepts in this pdf book
    - for each concept, link related concepts in the book content
    - the conept and linked concept should be stored as {pdf_books_dir}/{the book pdf file name}.knowlege_graph.json
    - when building the knowledge graph, show me a progressing bar from 0% to 100%
    - once the knowlege_graph is built, next time when we open the book modal and click on this button, directory load the knowledge graph json

    - when the knowlege graph is loaded, open a new modal on top of the book modal, in this modal {
      - draw a linked diagram for all the concepts and related concepts
      - user should be able to use the arrow keys to navigate the knowlege graph like navigating a map
    }
  }
}

